p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"201\" style=\"width: 201px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>offInternetLetter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"161\" style=\"width: 161px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"698\" style=\"width: 698px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>单机承诺函下载地址 如：http://xxx.xxx.xxx/xx/xx/xx.png，核准（备案）类型为不联网时填写</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"201\" style=\"width: 201px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>testAccount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"129\" style=\"width: 129px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"161\" style=\"width: 161px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"698\" style=\"width: 698px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>测试账号，支持最多传5个，传字符串JSON数据格式：<br>[{\"testAccount\":\"xxxxx\",\"testPassword\":\"xxxxx\"}]</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-d9ggyr9o\">响应参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"135\" style=\"width: 135px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\"><p><strong>是否返回</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"202\" style=\"width: 202px\"><p><strong>字段说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>code</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"135\" style=\"width: 135px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>int</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"202\" style=\"width: 202px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>返回状态码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>subCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"135\" style=\"width: 135px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"202\" style=\"width: 202px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>业务返回码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"172\" style=\"width: 172px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>msg</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"135\" style=\"width: 135px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"202\" style=\"width: 202px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>结果描述</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-ajwnbjy5\">响应示例</h2><pre><code>成功示例：\n{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"code\":0,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"subCode\"&nbsp;:&nbsp;\"0\",\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"msg\":\"成功\"\n}\n\n失败示例：\n{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"code\":10001,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"msg\":\"签名校验失败\"\n}\n\n业务失败示例\n{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"code\":0,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"subCode\"&nbsp;:&nbsp;\"12010\",\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"msg\":\"当前更新应用审核中，不允许更新\"\n}</code></pre><p><br></p><h2 id=\"s-ad7rm1yv\">业务返回码</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\"><p><strong>返回码</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"539\" style=\"width: 539px\"><p><strong>描述</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12001</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"539\" style=\"width: 539px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请求参数不合法（提示具体参数问题原因）</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12002</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"539\" style=\"width: 539px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>应用不存在，更新失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12003</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"539\" style=\"width: 539px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>网络游戏出版物号格式错误</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12004</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"539\" style=\"width: 539px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>应用修改审核中，更新失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12007</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"539\" style=\"width: 539px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>应用类型对应vivo上架应用不一致</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12008</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"539\" style=\"width: 539px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>更新版本比vivo上架版本低，更新失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12009</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"539\" style=\"width: 539px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>游戏不能同版本更新</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12010</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"539\" style=\"width: 539px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>当前更新应用审核中，不允许更新</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12012</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"539\" style=\"width: 539px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>版本更新频率过快，更新失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCel